gZ_(){return"# Where to go\nNothing has to be decided yet \u2014 jot down anywhere that catches your eye.\n\n## Dates\n- Leaving\n- Coming back\n- Booking reference for the room\n\n## Places to visit\n- First stop of the day\n- Somewhere for a rainy afternoon\n- A shop to drop into on the way back\n\n> Fill it in as it firms up, and on the day this one page is all you need to look at."},
gZ2(){return"Packing and budget"},
gZ1(){return"# Packing\n- [ ] ID and tickets\n- [ ] Charger and power bank\n- [ ] Any medication\n- [ ] Change of clothes\n\n# Rough budget\n- Travel\n- Somewhere to stay\n- Food and souvenirs\n\nTickets saved as a photo or a PDF can be attached to this page."},
